<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts $1.50 higher than last Friday.  Trading slow. Top $60.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   59.75-60.25</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   59.25-59.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   58.25-59.25</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs steady; 450-500 lbs 1.00 higher; 500-650 lbs $2.00 higher. Top 55.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    50.50, few 51.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    52.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    53.00-55.00</p>
</text>
